{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">2008 AMC 10A #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/5086ca4e08ddc4e7a20b6b10fdf8d0824706658f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2x}{3}-\\frac{x}{6}\\]\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />\nis an integer. Which of the following statements must be true about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e14b76ffc7fce349df6bdd927b9770ab17d906c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{It is negative.}\\\\\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{It is even, but not necessarily a multiple of 3.}\\\\\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{It is a multiple of 3, but not necessarily even.}\\\\\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{It is a multiple of 6, but not necessarily a multiple of 12.}\\\\\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{It is a multiple of 12.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfcc085910df27c7cc1f6881760996e40ed36ff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2x}{3}-\\frac{x}{6}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{4x}{6}-\\frac{x}{6}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{3x}{6}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{x}{2}\\]\" width=\"372\" height=\"37\" />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876fba774d252c254bd1496f6a44b4db630e55cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"16\" height=\"34\" /> to be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be even, but not necessarily divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5cf5dbc8229738cf06adbf2aa73fd75994b058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20